---
// Uber API Gateway 3-Generation Evolution Diagram Component
---

<figure class="uber-gw-diagram" aria-labelledby="uber-gw-caption">
  <svg
    class="uber-gw-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="uber-gw-title uber-gw-desc"
  >
    <title id="uber-gw-title">Uber API 閘道三代演進</title>
    <desc id="uber-gw-desc">
      依 Uber 2020 年 Edge Gateway 專文與 2021 年閘道架構文：第 1 代（2014）是
      dispatch 與 api 兩個服務，ApiCommand 兼任入口；第 2 代（2015
      年初起）是集中式 Node.js RTAPI；第 3 代（2018 年起）是 Go 寫成的 Edge
      Gateway，用 Thrift IDL 與 YAML 設定、Zanzibar 生成程式碼，並把職責分成
      edge、presentation、 product、domain 四層。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="ugw-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="ugw-arrow-emerald"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head--emerald"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Gen 1: dispatch + api -->
    <g class="uber-gw-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">GEN 1 (2014)</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__title" x="16" y="52">dispatch ＋ api</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• dispatch：媒合乘客與司機</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• api：使用者與行程儲存</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• ApiCommand 代理請求</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__tag uber-gw-diagram__tag--info"
        x="16"
        y="152">ApiCommand 兼任入口</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Gen 2: RTAPI -->
    <g class="uber-gw-diagram__card" transform="translate(260, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">GEN 2 (2015–)</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__title" x="16" y="52"
        >集中式 Node.js RTAPI</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 尖峰約 800,000 req/s</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• 約 1,600 支 API、40+ 部署</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• 業務邏輯滲進閘道</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__tag uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn"
        x="16"
        y="152">⚠️ NPE 與閘道團隊瓶頸</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Gen 3: Edge Gateway -->
    <g class="uber-gw-diagram__card" transform="translate(490, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">GEN 3 (2018–)</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__title" x="16" y="52">Edge Gateway (Go)</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 單一 Go 服務搭配 UI</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• Thrift IDL ＋ YAML 設定</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• Zanzibar 生成程式碼</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__tag uber-gw-diagram__tag--info"
        x="16"
        y="152">ℹ️ BFF 移出閘道</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Gen 3 layers (Large Bottom Block) -->
    <g
      class="uber-gw-diagram__card uber-gw-diagram__card--emerald"
      transform="translate(30, 240)"
    >
      <rect width="900" height="180" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__badge uber-gw-diagram__badge--emerald"
        x="20"
        y="26">GEN 3: SELF-SERVICE, DECENTRALIZED, AND LAYERED</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__title uber-gw-diagram__title--emerald"
        x="20"
        y="56">第 3 代的四層分工</text
      >

      <!-- Sub Column 1: Edge layer -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 75)">
        <rect width="265" height="85" rx="8" class="uber-gw-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="22"
          >01. Edge layer</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 驗證、限流、負載卸除</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 協定轉換 JSON／Thrift／Protobuf</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Sub Column 2: Presentation + Product -->
      <g transform="translate(315, 75)">
        <rect width="270" height="85" rx="8" class="uber-gw-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="22"
          >02. Presentation ＋ Product</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• BFF 微服務負責聚合</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 可重用的產品 API</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Sub Column 3: Domain layer -->
      <g transform="translate(615, 75)">
        <rect width="265" height="85" rx="8" class="uber-gw-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="22"
          >03. Domain layer</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 提供單一功能的末端服務</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 2019 年已有 2,200+ 微服務</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connecting Arrows across Generations -->
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 125 H 255"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 460 125 H 485"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald"
      d="M 590 210 V 235"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow-emerald)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version -->
  <div class="uber-gw-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card">
      <span class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge">第 1 代 (2014)</span>
      <h4>dispatch ＋ api</h4>
      <p>
        dispatch 媒合乘客與司機，api 儲存使用者與行程；請求經 dispatch 以
        ApiCommand 代理到 api。從閘道角度看，ApiCommand 兼任進入 Uber 的入口。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 2015 年初起</div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card">
      <span class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge">第 2 代 (2015 年初起)</span>
      <h4>集中式 Node.js RTAPI</h4>
      <p>
        尖峰約每秒 800,000 個請求、約 1,600 支 API。業務邏輯滲進閘道，動態語言與
        NPE 拖住部署，閘道團隊成為產品開發的瓶頸。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 2018 年起</div>

    <div
      class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card--emerald"
    >
      <span
        class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge--emerald"
        >第 3 代 (2018 年起)</span
      >
      <h4>Edge Gateway（Go）與四層分工</h4>
      <p>
        單一 Go 服務搭配 UI，用 Thrift IDL 與 YAML 設定、Zanzibar
        生成程式碼。BFF 移到 presentation layer，其下是 product 與 domain
        layer。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="uber-gw-caption">
    圖 1：Uber API 閘道三代演進，依 Uber 2020 年 Edge Gateway 專文與 2021
    年閘道架構文整理。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .uber-gw-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--dg-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram {
    background: #090e17;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .uber-gw-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #131b2e;
    stroke: #25334d;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__card--emerald rect {
    fill: #f0fdf4;
    stroke: #10b981;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__card--emerald rect {
    fill: #062e24;
    stroke: #059669;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff !important;
    stroke: #a7f3d0 !important;
    stroke-width: 1.2 !important;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #0d382f !important;
    stroke: #047857 !important;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__badge--emerald {
    fill: #059669;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__badge--emerald {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__title--emerald {
    font-size: 16px;
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__title--emerald {
    fill: #6ee7b7;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__subtitle {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #065f46;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__subtitle {
    fill: #a7f3d0;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__subdesc {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__subdesc {
    fill: #d1fae5;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn {
    fill: #d97706;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__tag--info {
    fill: #2563eb;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__tag--info {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald {
    stroke: #10b981;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald {
    stroke: #34d399;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head--emerald {
    fill: #10b981;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head--emerald {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive for mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .uber-gw-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card {
      background: #131b2e;
      border-color: #25334d;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card--emerald {
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      background: #f0fdf4;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card--emerald {
      background: #062e24;
      border-color: #059669;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge--emerald {
      color: #059669;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge--emerald {
      color: #34d399;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
